DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
15335::$$$message_0117_0000_0000$$$::I left the lunch preparation to Sakura and came shopping.[lr]::
15336::$$$message_0117_0000_0001$$$::Now, I wonder what I should do for dinner today. It's autumn after all, so seasonal food would be good.[lr]::
15337::$$$message_0117_0000_0002$$$::"Yeah, like chestnut rice for example."::
15338::$$$message_0117_0001_0000$$$::As I'm walking, I spot Caster.[lr]::
15339::$$$message_0117_0001_0001$$$::I wonder if she's getting groceries like I am.[lr]::
15340::$$$message_0117_0001_0002$$$::It must be for shopping, as she's peeking into the storefront holding a tote bag. I probably don't need to go out of my way to talk to her.[lr]::
15341::$$$message_0117_0001_0003$$$::I'll just get my own shopping out of the way...::
15342::$$$message_0117_0002_0000$$$::I finish shopping. Fresh saury was cheap today so this will be the main dish for dinner. [l]There were also some mushrooms that seemed good, so we'll have seasoned rice.::
15343::$$$message_0117_0003_0000$$$::As I think about what I should do for the side dish, I see Caster again.[lr]::
15344::$$$message_0117_0003_0001$$$::It seems like she came at a similar time, so it seems like she's about to finish shopping and go home...[l]but she's acting weird.[lr]::
15345::$$$message_0117_0003_0002$$$::There's not much in her tote bag that she's holding, yet she's still looking at various storefronts.::
15346::$$$message_0117_0004_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
15347::$$$message_0117_0004_0001$$$::Now that I've noticed, I can't bear overlooking it.[lr]::
15348::$$$message_0117_0004_0002$$$::Out of the goodwill of a fellow homemaker, I call out to her.::
15349::$$$message_0117_0005_0000$$$::"Hey. What have you been doing, Caster?"[lr]::
15350::$$$message_0117_0005_0001$$$::"...Oh, the boy from Saber's place."[lr]::
15351::$$$message_0117_0005_0002$$$::Even when I got pretty close to her, she didn't notice me until I talked to her.[lr]::
15352::$$$message_0117_0005_0003$$$::Is she ruminating over something serious?::
15353::$$$message_0117_0006_0000$$$::"What are you doing yourself, boy?"[lr]::
15354::$$$message_0117_0006_0001$$$::"I'm shopping for dinner as you can see. You are too, right?"[lr]::
15355::$$$message_0117_0006_0002$$$::"Yes..."[lr]::
15356::$$$message_0117_0006_0003$$$::She says and looks at my shopping bag.[lr]::
15357::$$$message_0117_0006_0004$$$::Naturally, the groceries that I just bought are in there, waiting to be cooked.::
15358::$$$message_0117_0007_0000$$$::"...Could it be that you know how to cook, boy?"[lr]::
15359::$$$message_0117_0007_0001$$$::"I can, no need to guess. I take care of most of the chores at home. It's the same for you, right, Caster?"[lr]::
15360::$$$message_0117_0007_0002$$$::"Yes, well..."[lr]::
15361::$$$message_0117_0007_0003$$$::Her response is inarticulate for some reason.::
15362::$$$message_0117_0008_0000$$$::"So, you seem to be looking around, but is there something you're looking for?"[lr]::
15363::$$$message_0117_0008_0001$$$::"...Have you been watching the whole time, boy?"[lr]::
15364::$$$message_0117_0008_0002$$$::"Of course not, even I don't have that much time on my hands. When I came to shop, you were just there."::
15365::$$$message_0117_0009_0000$$$::"...I see."[lr]::
15366::$$$message_0117_0009_0001$$$::"If you're looking for something, should I show you around? You don't know this area well yet, right?"[lr]::
15367::$$$message_0117_0009_0002$$$::"Yes, that is true, but..."[lr]::
15368::$$$message_0117_0009_0003$$$::She's being awfully indecisive.::
15369::$$$message_0117_0010_0000$$$::"If I'm being a nuisance, then I'll just go home."[lr]::
15370::$$$message_0117_0010_0001$$$::"...That's not it, boy.[lr]::
15371::$$$message_0117_0010_0002$$$::First of all, I don't even know what I should make."[lr]::
15372::$$$message_0117_0010_0003$$$::"Um, I don't know what you mean."[lr]::
15373::$$$message_0117_0010_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=キャスター私服02b(中) textoff=0]Caster hangs her head slightly and sighs.::
15374::$$$message_0117_0011_0000$$$::"I don't know what to do with this country's ingredients."[lr]::
15375::$$$message_0117_0011_0001$$$::"Oh."[lr]::
15376::$$$message_0117_0011_0002$$$::I see, so that's what she means. Come to think of it, Rider was saying something similar. That she doesn't know what to get or how to get it.[lr]::
15377::$$$message_0117_0011_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=キャスター私服03c(中)]...Well, I guess that's a bit of a different situation.::
15378::$$$message_0117_0012_0000$$$::"Then if you tell me what kind of thing you want to make, I can tell you what you should get.[lr]::
15379::$$$message_0117_0012_0001$$$::For example, like what Mr. Kuzuki wants to eat or[line len=3]"[lr]::
15380::$$$message_0117_0012_0002$$$::"Souichirou will eat anything, no matter what I make. When I asked him before, he said anything is fine as long as I make it."[lr]::
15381::$$$message_0117_0012_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=キャスター私服01c(中) textoff=0]Some weird switch must've been turned on, as she says that rather happily.::
15382::$$$message_0117_0013_0000$$$::"Okay. If you just want to brag, I'll be heading home."[lr]::
15383::$$$message_0117_0013_0001$$$::"Wait, boy! That's not it!"[lr]::
15384::$$$message_0117_0013_0002$$$::That's great.[lr]::
15385::$$$message_0117_0013_0003$$$::If people mistook us for newlyweds in the middle of the shopping district, I would melt from embarrassment.::
15386::$$$message_0117_0014_0000$$$::"Then why don't you just make something you're able to make?"[lr]::
15387::$$$message_0117_0014_0001$$$::"But, Souichirou seems to like this country's food[line len=3][cacheimage storage=キャスター私服03a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=キャスター私服03a(中) textoff=0]besides, it's a temple."[lr]::
15388::$$$message_0117_0014_0002$$$::...Is that really what a witch, who sucked up energy from the people of the town and made the temple her territory, should be saying?::
15389::$$$message_0117_0015_0000$$$::"Oh well... No matter what you end up doing, tell me what kind of thing you're trying to make."[lr]::
15390::$$$message_0117_0015_0001$$$::"...Let's see..."::
15391::$$$message_0117_0016_0000$$$::I couldn't abandon Caster, who talks awfully happily about Mr. Kuzuki, so I ended up accompanying her until the end after all.[lr]::
15392::$$$message_0117_0016_0001$$$::...Without knowing that this was the start of all kinds of trouble.::
915358::$$$message_9117_0007_0000$$$::"...Could it be that you know how to cook, boy?"[r]::

